{"step_index":131,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-18T00:16:53Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-18T09:16:53+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-09-18T09:16:55+09:00\nThe search for \"site:kyobobook.co.kr \"051-709-5958\"\" returned the following summary:\n전화번호 **(051) 709-5958**은 교보문고 매장에서 사용하는 대표 전화번호입니다[1][2]. \n\n해당 번호는 교보문고의 여러 매장 안내 페이지에서 확인되며, 주로 매장 내 도서 재고 확인이나 위치 안내 등과 관련하여 게시되고 있습니다[1][3][4]. 특정 도서의 재고 현황을 검색할 때 해당 전화번호와 함께 매장 내 상세 위치(예: [A관 0-24] 벽면 등)가 안내되는 경우가 많습니다[1][5][6].\n\nSources:\n[1] [kyobobook.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF7zASmZ_EB1s5T57pNmyOtCFy-U-n_jOYeqjDO1w7EyjkdlkQYhpllOlyqDE4nQamdQzbWDPigisQd07NyOITa184dDhUPkkU3iBZJQTPqlW8ecjGLmlJDomtHCv86sHnJiFJJzO_OiVSVSu7hk6TqfDzFt__Gf2sNpnAPp1I-B56mJOB8KY6s)\n[2] [kyobobook.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFevMsXWHcGmHRQTck3v3ayHTH-QDelCkh0KTIBP25S7TYwGO6eaJKWm8EEhqQJ7EhPl6GeEBemmjkyIcKKEyutLC7OKh3E8knaMnIR1IvHHCscdFgjxmlCqk7_Ll_aClonuMeOr63oASHUmdw1-OS8m_6VOgPMrLE9wyGSVlHzdZFDLwhgHcrh)\n[3] [kyobobook.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEv0_qsLYbwRqFn4JVrlWwSYLuxi2bCb460Heb6PPLCj_7Pq3DIRL_gT7zb-fSCHI3gbYF6lHEGXWruAqQBahmmFFtVm4Q-_1k-oKFC8Oy7RMjD31NyFpigiP0yhPLXekBYhffhnf11A-Yal22uydk_vbC2ngbbFlCnIb2_lhdfU7flbpFUCN2p)\n[4] [kyobobook.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFvs1uygIy48RAJnQ9lQCWOZE203s4XrERvxfFLOAGng_IYMXbM_lAgZ2L2g3nyxCnHcIxmRfWP5BkuGT7gMmNgt62GR-N035u3e7JPtbOnsCiVmVRhj6FpvYOWqX8UJu8_gHsAXsSJqeSCSw4RC-CE_5UjAo2tYTEy_4EOQyLnL7Swxt2Wz0m5)\n[5] [kyobobook.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG0TOcxnHpEHzhZymrbLoxJKBunIMpd4q_Iym47zQHvGGWrE_oMomcq3hC_iQi3vIU5MD0whnb8uT-liFNjLeLrC71YAOSuolsBJXsmoHrGf5JJn5JPnwkYcmYpnTkXJIshap3e7G6kzSOnhOmQJurwvT7fR3JROffsgpBe-FJPWM-rLIfwPqEm)\n[6] [kyobobook.co.kr](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/A